{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37577","headline":"梁烛处士辞金陵相国杜公归旧山因以寄赠 · 郑谷","name":"梁烛处士辞金陵相国杜公归旧山因以寄赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相庭留不得，江野有苔矶。\n两浙寻山徧，孤舟载鹤归。\n世间书读尽，云外客来稀。\n谏署搜贤急，应难惜布衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}